#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create your own pass manager {#create-your-own-pass-manager}"
msgstr "Buat pass manager sendiri {#create-your-own-pass-manager}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The "
"[qiskit.transpiler.passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_passes)"
" module includes many transpiler passes that can be used to create pass "
"managers. To create a pass manager, initialize a `PassManager` with a list "
"of passes. For example, the following code creates a transpiler pass that "
"merges adjacent two-qubit gates and then synthesizes them into a basis of "
"[$R_y$](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RYGate),"
" "
"[$R_z$](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate),"
" and "
"[$R_{xx}$](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXXGate),"
"  gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Modul "
"[qiskit.transpiler.passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_passes)"
" mencakup banyak transpiler passes yang bisa digunakan untuk membuat pass "
"managers. Untuk membuat pass manager, inisialisasi `PassManager` dengan "
"daftar passes. Misalnya, kode berikut membuat transpiler pass yang "
"menggabungkan Gate dua qubit yang berdekatan lalu mensintesisnya ke dalam "
"basis "
"[$R_y$](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RYGate),"
" "
"[$R_z$](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate),"
" dan "
"[$R_{xx}$](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXXGate).\n"

